{"steam_appid":3573070,"steam_name":"Toy Smash Kaboom!","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3573070/1833555651/e75c1843087d52203bdcc4b60e83ca6ecbf7f7b7/1764750727/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1764831320","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257238620/6f08c5603e91e6327baef22195000b32c617e3ee/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1764831320","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573070/4ead423b6325333d7997a5c2311362f6265625a3/ss_4ead423b6325333d7997a5c2311362f6265625a3.1920x1080.jpg?t=1784282568","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573070/de77f311aadd191c324144401b7c1ee892243540/ss_de77f311aadd191c324144401b7c1ee892243540.1920x1080.jpg?t=1784282568","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573070/98c1f7d025d5b7c95519e40e18ff76d1179e9f72/ss_98c1f7d025d5b7c95519e40e18ff76d1179e9f72.1920x1080.jpg?t=1784282568","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573070/7d0118bf39460407317a183cca2be5cbd461b47c/ss_7d0118bf39460407317a183cca2be5cbd461b47c.1920x1080.jpg?t=1784282568","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573070/17144da2ac484abcedb19914215393602d7b89fe/ss_17144da2ac484abcedb19914215393602d7b89fe.1920x1080.jpg?t=1784282568"],"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join Our Official <strong>Discord</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(You can access Discord link from the panel on the right.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573070/extras/9cd90ef45bc52840f1b1ca7de026bea8.poster.avif?t=1784282568\" width=647 height=145 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573070/extras/9cd90ef45bc52840f1b1ca7de026bea8.webm?t=1784282568\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573070/extras/276368be29482474f2f364cca8aaf214.avif?t=1784282568\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573070/extras_big/276368be29482474f2f364cca8aaf214.avif?t=1784282568 width=800 height=91 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the dusty corner of memory, the toy room stirs once more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Awaken forgotten childhood toys and fuse them within the small table to craft your own kaboom legion — from ground collisions to aerial strikes and magical blasts. Through each tabletop battle, fragments of your long-lost childhood return…</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573070/extras/a653b63d714b86955e7dee9864fe0e53.poster.avif?t=1784282568\" width=1039 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573070/extras/a653b63d714b86955e7dee9864fe0e53.webm?t=1784282568\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >            </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573070/extras/ab089feb23e65783cd22fd7da4aeeeee.avif?t=1784282568\" width=800 height=151 /></span>Arrange, Combine, and Evolve</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the art of toy arrangement on your tabletop! Every toy slot is a strategic decision. Plan your layout, combine rare units, and arrange them wisely to unlock your build’s full potential!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573070/extras/0cd5c17d1d9144065316e884b3b64a8a.poster.avif?t=1784282568\" width=1038 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573070/extras/0cd5c17d1d9144065316e884b3b64a8a.webm?t=1784282568\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build Your Playstyle</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft your own tactical system from over 400 strategic toys!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100+ summons to clash in tabletop battles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >50+ traps and class abilities to outsmart your opponents and shift momentum</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >250+ magic items and weapons to power up your strategy and unleash devastating combos</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573070/extras/7673602b1e8ba7e8d4f95a0d04e740f9.poster.avif?t=1784282568\" width=1038 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573070/extras/7673602b1e8ba7e8d4f95a0d04e740f9.webm?t=1784282568\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573070/extras/6e20767586a723ddd9db20c28e3b95fe.avif?t=1784282568\" width=800 height=151 /></span>Collisions &amp; Knockback</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Summon toys into head-to-head battles where it’s not just about stats—brave charges and knockback strikes can send enemies flying, turning the tide in unpredictable ways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573070/extras/46c587976bc0ceb868280986daf56704.poster.avif?t=1784282568\" width=1038 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573070/extras/46c587976bc0ceb868280986daf56704.webm?t=1784282568\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Set Traps</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set traps across the table to break enemy momentum and open up opportunities to strike back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573070/extras/17395743d0ca2baf2f73de9b107b418a.poster.avif?t=1784282568\" width=1038 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573070/extras/17395743d0ca2baf2f73de9b107b418a.webm?t=1784282568\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573070/extras/27dda68a2e9077b32cda1e362120cfee.avif?t=1784282568\" width=800 height=151 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in asynchronous PvP where your legion clashes with global builds in tactical showdowns. Analyze, adapt, and optimize your strategy in mirror matches and rise through the ranks.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Pick Your Toy Captain</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each hero brings a unique toy arsenal and exclusive class abilities.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Doll Chef: A kitchen defense expert who controls space and fortifies positions, perfect for defensive-minded players.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dr. Hamster: Commander of Hamster Legion that leads a swarm of tiny units to overwhelm enemies with relentless numbers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puppet Musician: A rhythm master who speeds up allies and disrupts foes, setting the tempo of every battle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Naughty Andy: Summoner of nightmares — ghosts, skeletons, reapers, and dark curses!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Frost Hunter: Rule the frozen land, command wild beasts, and unleash the power of water magic!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573070/extras/1e63d83ac7ce2509e89327d1cd31dc84.poster.avif?t=1784282568\" width=1038 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573070/extras/1e63d83ac7ce2509e89327d1cd31dc84.webm?t=1784282568\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573070/extras/1e63d83ac7ce2509e89327d1cd31dc84.mp4?t=1784282568\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Turn Your Friends into Toys</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Transform your Steam friends into fully armed &quot;Game Buddy&quot;, customize them with all kinds of weapons and attributes, then rally them into your toy army to charge into battle for friendship!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573070/extras/94db0d27bbaadb2b4039fd821e3fd86f.poster.avif?t=1784282568\" width=1039 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573070/extras/94db0d27bbaadb2b4039fd821e3fd86f.webm?t=1784282568\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573070/extras/23d4e0504e4ee58cbba2996543e9fd46.avif?t=1784282568\" width=800 height=151 /></span>Unveil Toy Memories</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock achievements, hero skins, and the toys’ hidden memories through a pop-up storybook. Within its dusty pages, the long-lost tales of Fred and his childhood friends quietly come back to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573070/extras/71aa0f8faa68e007cfa7f83d91d7f5d8.poster.avif?t=1784282568\" width=1038 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573070/extras/71aa0f8faa68e007cfa7f83d91d7f5d8.webm?t=1784282568\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573070/extras/276368be29482474f2f364cca8aaf214.avif?t=1784282568\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573070/extras_big/276368be29482474f2f364cca8aaf214.avif?t=1784282568 width=800 height=91 /></span></p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64bit / Windows 11 64bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-750, 2.67 GHz / AMD A12-9800, 3.80 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 750 Ti, 2 GB / AMD Radeon HD 7770, 2 GB / Intel Iris Plus<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64bit / Windows 11 64bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-2300, 2.80 GHz / AMD Ryzen 3 1200, 3.10 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 760 / AMD Radeon R9 270X / Intel Arc A380<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>","genres":["Casual","Indie","Strategy"],"developers":["Free Particle"],"publishers":["Free Particle","Paleo","XD"],"release_date":"3 Dec, 2025"}